ShortDescription: Solar-position dynamic wallpaper daemon, without the settings window
Description: |-
  The Dwall daemon on its own: it applies the wallpaper that matches the current
  solar position and can register itself to start at sign-in. It needs no WebView2
  runtime and ships no settings window.

  Configuration lives in %APPDATA%\dwall\config.toml, which is created with
  comments on the first run; `dwall --check-config` validates an edit, `dwall
  --once` applies a single update cycle, and `dwall --install-autostart` registers
  the daemon for sign-in. See docs/headless.md in the release archive.
